--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Relinking
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

arduino-esp32 (LGPL-2.1) and, through ESP-IDF, some LGPL components are linked
statically into firmware.bin. To rebuild this firmware against a modified copy
of those libraries:

  1. Install PlatformIO and clone this repository.
  2. `pio run` — platformio.ini pins platform = espressif32 @ 6.12.0, which
     pins the arduino-esp32 core and ESP-IDF 4.4.7. Nothing else is required;
     all first-party libraries are bundled in lib/.
  3. Replace the framework package under ~/.platformio/packages with your
     modified copy and run `pio run` again.
  4. Flash .pio/build/xteink_x4/firmware.bin — see the README. On a
     USB-locked device this is done from the SD card through the Escape Hatch.

This is not legal advice; it is a statement of what the project provides.
